{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】維港上空上演無人機表演，以南韓男團BIGBANG作為主題。</p>\n<p>多架無人機在空中砌出多種圖案，包括演場會主題標誌、團名、應援棒及團員樣貌等，吸引大批市民及遊客在尖沙咀海旁觀賞，表演歷時約15分鐘，在演唱會前夕打響頭炮。</p>\n<p>周六晚上10時會再有一場無人機表演。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:44:26.740566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:21:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:38:00.991492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:38:00.991492+00:00","content_hash":"a4d36ce94e4fd3bd4d51b6b1ab9fcf73d4484db96de13294c8fb5cb01815bf8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}